<title>UK: LIFFE sugar ends higher after muted days trade.</title>
<headline>LIFFE sugar ends higher after muted days trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE white sugar ended higher after a muted day's trading.</p>
<p>New York's lacklustre performance failed to inspire, traders said. No sharp move was likely in London until New York gets out of its current range, they said.</p>
<p>By the close front month October was $1.10 higher at $329.00. October dominated the volume with 967 of a total 1,861 lots.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
</text>
